(1, 1, 'Business process automation', 'Many growing businesses lose time and money due to inefficient workflows and outdated systems. We build custom automation that eliminates manual work and scales your operations.', 'View Our Presentation', '/assets/Sidis-Group.pdf', 'Free audit', '#getintouch', './assets/video/compressed-v2/Video-cover-hero-case.mp4', NULL, NULL, 'Why Businesses\nChoose RPA?', 'We Build Future-Proof Automation', 'Many small and medium-sized enterprises encounter operational bottlenecks due to time-consuming administrative tasks, redundant data handling, and disconnected software solutions.', '', 'Estonia', 'Tallinn', '', 'Switzerland', 'Lausanne', 'Automation Solutions', 'Implemented\nWorkflows', 'View All Projects', '/cases/', 'What clients say about us', 'GET IN TOUCH', '', 'Send', '#', 'Robotic Process Automation', 'Most SMEs can save time and money with RPA by automating tasks, reducing errors, and improving system integration.', 'As automation specialists, we offer a wide range of solutions that will be tailored to your business goals and operations.', 'Contact us', 'Free audit', 'Roadmap', 'Get PDF', '/assets/Sidis-Group.pdf', 'Free audit', '#getintouch', '', 'Fill out our contact form for a free consultation, or book an online meeting directly via Google Meet.', 'We discuss your project even if you have just a raw idea.', 'We choose a model and approach that are suitable for your case and budget.', 'Request a free Consultation', 'See RPA\nin Action', 'Bring Ideas To Life', 'Most SMEs waste hours each week on repetitive admin, duplicate data entry, or disjointed software systems. Sidis connects your tools so your team can focus on the work that matters.', './assets/video/compressed-v2/Video-cover-blog.mp4', '[1,2,3]', '[19,20,21]', '[33,34,35]', '/uploads/20260605_124323_3bfdd235.webp', '/uploads/20260605_124323_3bfdd235.webp', '', '[]', './assets/video/compressed-v2/Video-cover-roadmap.mp4', '', 0, 1, 1, 1, 1);
