(71, 13, 1, 'promo', 'Hero / Promo', 0, 1, '{\"title\":\"Unified Business Management Systems\",\"text\":\"Running your business across a dozen disconnected tools creates friction, blind spots, and wasted time across every department. We build unified management platforms that bring operations, data, workflows, and teams into a single system designed around how your business works. Finance, projects, clients, HR, and reporting — managed in one place with full visibility across the organization. Custom-built to your structure, integrated with existing tools, and built to scale.\",\"btn1_text\":\"View Our Presentation\",\"btn1_url\":\"\\/assets\\/Sidis-Group.pdf\",\"btn2_text\":\"Free audit\",\"btn2_url\":\"#getintouch\",\"image_id\":null,\"image_url\":\"\"}'),
