(131, 33, 1, 'promo', 'Hero / Promo', 0, 1, '{\"title\":\"Automation for Affiliate Marketing\",\"text\":\"Affiliate operations involve managing hundreds of partners, tracking performance across multiple networks, processing payouts, and running continuous outreach — all at high volume. Manual management doesn\'t scale here. We build automation systems for affiliate businesses that handle partner onboarding, campaign tracking, commission calculation, fraud detection workflows, and reporting. More partners managed efficiently, lower cost per operation, and the capacity to grow your program without growing your ops team proportionally.\",\"btn1_text\":\"View Our Presentation\",\"btn1_url\":\"\\/assets\\/Sidis-Group.pdf\",\"btn2_text\":\"Free audit\",\"btn2_url\":\"#getintouch\",\"image_id\":null,\"image_url\":\"\"}'),
