(141, 19, 1, 'promo', 'Hero / Promo', 0, 1, '{\"title\":\"Operations Department Automation\",\"text\":\"Operations is where inefficiency accumulates — manual handoffs, disconnected systems, and processes held together by individual effort that don\'t survive growth. We work with operations teams to map, redesign, and automate their core workflows: procurement, project coordination, vendor management, logistics, and internal reporting. Your operations become predictable, scalable, and resilient — able to handle growth without fragility from processes dependent on constant human oversight.\",\"btn1_text\":\"View Our Presentation\",\"btn1_url\":\"\\/assets\\/Sidis-Group.pdf\",\"btn2_text\":\"Free audit\",\"btn2_url\":\"#getintouch\",\"image_id\":null,\"image_url\":\"\"}'),
