(171, 26, 1, 'promo', 'Hero / Promo', 0, 1, '{\"title\":\"Product Team Automation\",\"text\":\"Product teams sit at the intersection of engineering, design, data, and business — which means heavy coordination and information management overhead. We automate the operational layer of your product workflow: feedback collection and routing, roadmap status updates, release communication, bug triage, and cross-team reporting. Less time chasing updates across Slack and spreadsheets, more time on the product decisions that actually move the roadmap and deliver value to your users.\",\"btn1_text\":\"View Our Presentation\",\"btn1_url\":\"\\/assets\\/Sidis-Group.pdf\",\"btn2_text\":\"Free audit\",\"btn2_url\":\"#getintouch\",\"image_id\":null,\"image_url\":\"\"}'),
