(251, 8, 1, 'promo', 'Hero / Promo', 0, 1, '{\"title\":\"Systems & API Integrations\",\"text\":\"Disconnected tools create data silos, manual handoffs, and processes that break every time something changes. We connect your software stack through custom API integrations and middleware — making your CRM, ERP, payment systems, communication tools, and data sources work together seamlessly. No more copy-pasting between platforms or waiting for syncs that fail silently. One connected system where data flows automatically to where it needs to go, when it needs to be there.\",\"btn1_text\":\"View Our Presentation\",\"btn1_url\":\"\\/assets\\/Sidis-Group.pdf\",\"btn2_text\":\"Free audit\",\"btn2_url\":\"#getintouch\",\"image_id\":null,\"image_url\":\"\"}'),
