(311, 16, 1, 'promo', 'Hero / Promo', 0, 1, '{\"title\":\"Data & Reporting Automation\",\"text\":\"Manually pulling data from multiple systems and building reports in spreadsheets is slow, error-prone, and delays decisions. We automate your data collection, transformation, and reporting pipelines so the right information reaches the right people automatically — in real time or on schedule. Custom dashboards, automated reports, and integrated analytics give your team clarity without the weekly manual scramble. Better data, faster decisions, and significantly less time wasted on preparation.\",\"btn1_text\":\"View Our Presentation\",\"btn1_url\":\"\\/assets\\/Sidis-Group.pdf\",\"btn2_text\":\"Free audit\",\"btn2_url\":\"#getintouch\",\"image_id\":null,\"image_url\":\"\"}'),
